# One production CPU work unit: 1500 stars at the production threshold, what the server's generator sends the CPU app
# (AGENTS.md, commit message of 1ecc658): about 1 hour per run on an Apple M1 (estimated from 2.3-2.6 s per star, not
# measured). Run it once per candidate for the final number, or once per side in a long session: three rounds of two
# builds are 6 hours. Two real stars and 1498 made up, so `out` has two rows and the trailer `# done 1500`. The first 40
# stars are short.wu's. A laptop may throttle in the second half of an hour, which interleaving spreads over both sides
# but does not remove.
iso oumuamua
stars 1500
anchors 2
star_seed 20261104
seed_base 1
time_myr -100
steps 100000
threshold_pc 50
apps cpu
